# Agent: v8-runner

Load skill `v8-runner` before using this tool.

## When to use

- Build or load CFE / main config into the infobase.
- Run `syntax designer-modules` / `syntax designer-config` / `syntax edt`.
- Run YAxUnit (`test yaxunit`) or Vanessa Automation (`test va`).
- Dump config or make `.cf`/`.cfe`/`.epf`/`.erf` artifacts.
- Launch 1C client, including MCP-enabled thin client.

## When not to use

- Locate BSL code — use `bsl-atlas` / `litecode` / `code-index` instead.
- Edit BSL/XML — use native edit after locate+consult.
- OData queries — use `1c-rest-mcp`.
- UI web e2e — use Playwright / `tests/web/`.
